{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123697","id":4597993515,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEg_QKw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123697","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123697.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123697.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123697","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123697/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123697/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123697/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/138639a77df38ca0d4992bf27f7dfcecbd77a109","number":123697,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix `TileMayLayer` editor's `custom_overlay` having wrong inheritance","user":{"login":"radioactivejackal1414","id":74024384,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDI0Mzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74024384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414","html_url":"https://github.com/radioactivejackal1414","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123669\r\n\r\nThis gives `custom_overlay` the same `texture_filter` setting as whatever the TileMapLayer would exhibit, which I believe was the original intention of this code and is the behavior I'd expect.\r\n\r\nIf the TileMapLayer is set to **Inherit**, this will walk up CanvasItem ancestors until it finds the texture filter that the TileMapLayer would inherit. If all ancestors are set to **Inherit**, it uses the Viewport's setting (which derives from the Project Settings > Rendering > Textures > Canvas Textures > Default Texture Filter).\r\n\r\nThis way, the preview will always be the same as whatever the TileMapLayer's filter is.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nOddly (depending on how you look at it), 'custom_overlay' also draws the tile warning textures. This means that those textures will also get filtered based on TileMapLayer's setting, but I imagine it's intended that they are always set to linear. This could be a followup issue / PR and isn't really related to this.\r\n\r\nTile warning textures rendered with Linear:\r\n<img width=\"914\" height=\"357\" alt=\"linear\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f847e79-e7d5-40d9-a143-68ade29d4ae7\" />\r\nTile warning textures rendered with Nearest (I assume this isn't supposed to happen...?):\r\n<img width=\"943\" height=\"385\" alt=\"nearest\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/749aa774-8b6f-4f1e-8d39-216157ec7535\" />\r\n\r\nThe only other things that `custom_overlay` draws appear to be the grid lines and the position of the cursor which updates in the bottom left corner (e.g., \"(4, -3)\" when the mouse is positioned there). This change has no effect on those being rendered.\r\n\r\nEdit:\r\n### Testing\r\n- Tested all possible `texture_filter` settings on TileMapLayer itself, a CanvasItem parent, and a CanvasItem ancestor\r\n- Verified that the previews use the Project Setting setting when all ancestors are set to Inherit.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-22T02:46:59Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T22:35:16Z","closed_at":"2026-09-22T22:30:56Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6fa2e9db4fadeaffbc658f94e81343d93950cd35","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"radioactivejackal1414:fix-texture-filter-preview","ref":"fix-texture-filter-preview","repo":{"id":952639608,"node_id":"R_kgDOOMggeA","name":"godot","full_name":"radioactivejackal1414/godot","owner":{"login":"radioactivejackal1414","id":74024384,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDI0Mzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74024384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414","html_url":"https://github.com/radioactivejackal1414","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/u